HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4e1db6ad, " \342\200\224 a fixed array's length is part of its type, so the index is checked here rather than at run time");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_71096103, "` is a C array member, so it belongs to a `record` inside an `extern` group \342\200\224 this record's layout is this language's, and a fixed array exists to match one a C compiler chose (\302\2474.19)");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_7375ef2e, "use `[T]` here: it grows, it is compared and hashed like any other value, and it is what every Heroes record holds");
